  "goodToKnow": "Büffeln (colloquial) means to cram or swot: für eine Prüfung büffeln, Vokabeln büffeln. It's a synonym of pauken. The image is of working as hard as a Büffel (buffalo). Students often büffeln before the Abitur, the final school exams. Regular: büffelte, gebüffelt. The plural of der Büffel is die Büffel."
